## Verification Plan

### Manual Verification
1. User will navigate to the new `/offer/payment` route to verify the branding matches LP1 and LP2 perfectly.
2. User will verify that the payment options display correctly and link to the correct Stripe checkouts.
3. User will test the deposit minimum logic (either by making a test payment or verifying email restriction).
